check 1
# Werewolf shapeshift: ScnDru (expansion, level 30, every skill at 20, right skill 223),
# -seed 1234; warp to the Blood Moor (level 2; variant
# blood-moor-empty: no monster population there) before frame 4
# (no target monster: the monster AI out of town differs, area B), then one right click at client pixel (330, 300), before frame 20's
# drain. Compares the cast (mode, states, stats), its missiles' or
# summons' effects and the draws. Area F2 (q-diff-skills-2).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name dru-werewolf
save ScnDru --class dru --expansion --level 30 --all-skills 20 --right-skill 223
seed 1234
ticks 70
seconds 300
channels state
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
input frame 20; rclick 330 300
